          "c": "我哋係朋友。",
          "j": "ngo5 dei6 hai6 pang4 jau5.",
          "e": "We are friends.",
          "note": "To talk about more than one, add <b>哋</b> (dei6): 我 (ngo5) \"I\" → 我哋 (ngo5 dei6) \"we\"; 你 (nei5) → 你哋 (nei5 dei6) \"you all\"; 佢 (keoi5) → 佢哋 (keoi5 dei6) \"they\". One rule, no exceptions.",
